                </tbody>
              </table></div>
              <b>6 swaps</b> in total, and 10 comparisons.</li>
            <li>
              <div class="tbl-wrap"><table class="tbl pass-tbl">
                <thead><tr><th>After</th><th>Smallest found</th><th>Array</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td>pass 1</td><td>1 (swap with 6)</td><td><code><b>1</b> 2 9 6 5</code></td></tr>
                  <tr><td>pass 2</td><td>2 (already there)</td><td><code><b>1 2</b> 9 6 5</code></td></tr>
                  <tr><td>pass 3</td><td>5 (swap with 9)</td><td><code><b>1 2 5</b> 6 9</code></td></tr>
                  <tr><td>pass 4</td><td>6 (already there)</td><td><code><b>1 2 5 6 9</b></code></td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table></div>
              Passes <b>2 and 4</b> swap a value with itself.</li>
            <li>
              <div class="tbl-wrap"><table class="tbl pass-tbl">
                <thead><tr><th>After</th><th>Key</th><th>Array</th><th>Shifts</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td>pass 1</td><td>2</td><td><code><b>2 6</b> 9 1 5</code></td><td>1</td></tr>
                  <tr><td>pass 2</td><td>9</td><td><code><b>2 6 9</b> 1 5</code></td><td>0</td></tr>
                  <tr><td>pass 3</td><td>1</td><td><code><b>1 2 6 9</b> 5</code></td><td>3</td></tr>
                  <tr><td>pass 4</td><td>5</td><td><code><b>1 2 5 6 9</b></code></td><td>2</td></tr>
